I close my umbrella.
It is not raining anymore.
It is suddenly very sunny.
I stay up by the canal.
The first real sun of the year is here.
It transforms the whole city.
I walk slowly along the water.
There are people everywhere all of a sudden.
Many people are walking their dogs.
The dogs are running and playing by the water.
Other people are sitting on the benches.
They are chatting and enjoying the beautiful weather.
It is not cold at all.
The forecast from the office is right.
It will stay sunny today.
I am happy about the light.
I will stay by the canal a little bit longer.
